// The derivation JSON writer (nixstore::derivationToJSON, through lowered/nixstore/DrvMarshal.mlir: `nix derivation
// show`'s format) as fill-drain.  The caller gives DrvUnparse's records as they lie (the outputs as {name, path, algo,
// hash} windows; the inputs, sources, arguments and the environment, __json at its place in key order, as rows of
// Texts: a count is its word's low 32 bits) and each output's kind; this module composes the WHOLE JSON text as one
// variadic trikeshed.combine of literal slices, escaped strings and list combineAlls, and drains it ONCE into the Text
// at `into`, sized once to the text.  Each escaped string is a combineAll over slices of Nix's JSON escape table (the
// StructuredAttrsOps/PrintOps table: \" \\ \b \f \n \r \t, \u00xx below 0x20).  An output's fields by kind
// (0 input-addressed: path; 1 fixed: hash, hashAlgo, path; 2 floating, 4 impure: hashAlgo; 3 deferred: none) are
// pieces whose lengths are 0 when absent.  Answers the text's bytes.
// Generated by a Python emitter (fresh names, constants hoisted), then edited by the skill's scripts/stf/writers-edit.py.
